  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS BANGKOK 2022-FOUNDATION FOR OLDER PERSONS BANGKOK V23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Promoting sustainable community-based forest management in Thailand, implemented by Foundation for Older Persons&#x2019; Development (FOPDEV) aims to contribute to rehabilitation, maintenance, conservation and effective use management of community forest in the targeted communities and forest areas at Ban Huai Nam Ma Community, Mae Suai, Chiang Rai Province and Pong Nam Ron, Chiang Mai Province. The objectives of the grant are to mitigate the poverty, creating food and livelihoods security including increased forest resources and areas that will gradually contribute to improve natural resources, create healthy environment and mitigate increasingly impacts of climate change and related hazards and natural disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
